1
00:01:30,544 --> 00:01:31,755
Hey, Pun.

2
00:01:31,755 --> 00:01:34,768
- Yeah?
- Seriously, man.

3
00:01:34,768 --> 00:01:37,680
Aren't you worried about Eva?

4
00:01:37,680 --> 00:01:40,840
I know the cops say
they're keeping an eye on things.

5
00:01:41,803 --> 00:01:43,604
Oh...

6
00:01:44,310 --> 00:01:47,728
I forgot to tell you.
We changed the whole plan this morning.

7
00:01:47,728 --> 00:01:48,827
Oh, yeah?

8
00:01:48,827 --> 00:01:50,628
Here's what we're gonna do.

9
00:01:52,806 --> 00:01:55,728
<i>Breaking news on the story
that has gripped the nation since yesterday.</i>

10
00:01:55,728 --> 00:01:58,392
<i>A brazen shooting and chase that erupted</i>

11
00:01:58,392 --> 00:02:00,731
<i>while actress Eva was live streaming</i>

12
00:02:00,731 --> 00:02:02,347
<i>shocking revelations involving Weechana,</i>

13
00:02:02,347 --> 00:02:07,320
<i>a parliamentary candidate from
the Ruam Thai Chana Party, and his family.</i>

14
00:02:07,320 --> 00:02:08,451
<i>The party has announced</i>

15
00:02:08,451 --> 00:02:10,216
<i>that it will hold a press conference
this afternoon,</i>

16
00:02:10,216 --> 00:02:13,448
<i>saying for now that the incident
appears to have been a misunderstanding.</i>

17
00:02:13,448 --> 00:02:16,589
<i>However, a video has since surfaced
showing someone</i>

18
00:02:16,589 --> 00:02:18,883
<i>who appears to be party leader Weechana
at the scene.</i>

19
00:02:18,883 --> 00:02:20,280
<i>More importantly, the public is now</i>

20
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:21,884
<i>demanding answers to one urgent question.</i>

21
00:02:21,884 --> 00:02:23,656
<i>Where is Eva?</i>

22
00:02:23,656 --> 00:02:25,821
The police are here.
They want to search the house.

23
00:02:48,373 --> 00:02:50,267
Good morning, sir.

24
00:02:50,267 --> 00:02:52,901
We're here to conduct
a search of the premises.

25
00:02:55,021 --> 00:02:57,021
Here's the warrant.

26
00:03:17,101 --> 00:03:19,202
[Forensic Science Office]

27
00:03:27,035 --> 00:03:29,488
- Please come in.
- Excuse us.

28
00:03:29,488 --> 00:03:32,325
You check upstairs. We'll take this side.

29
00:03:32,325 --> 00:03:34,126
You take the left side.

30
00:04:04,341 --> 00:04:05,360
Hello, Mr. Noppol.

31
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:07,205
<i>This is a tough job.</i>

32
00:04:07,205 --> 00:04:10,523
<i>I'm pulling every string I can,
both inside and outside,</i>

33
00:04:10,523 --> 00:04:13,179
<i>but I have to warn you,</i>

34
00:04:13,179 --> 00:04:15,381
<i>we may not be able to plug every leak.</i>

35
00:04:15,381 --> 00:04:17,941
<i>You might want to have a lifeboat ready.</i>

36
00:04:29,019 --> 00:04:31,227
The office looks spotless, sir.

37
00:04:31,227 --> 00:04:32,891
At least to the naked eye.

38
00:04:32,891 --> 00:04:36,277
But once we sprayed
the blood-detection reagent,

39
00:04:36,277 --> 00:04:38,464
the whole room lit up.

40
00:04:38,464 --> 00:04:41,483
Because it indicates
possible traces of blood.

41
00:04:41,483 --> 00:04:43,653
We just don't know whose yet.

42
00:04:43,653 --> 00:04:45,883
I'd like to secure the area

43
00:04:45,883 --> 00:04:49,141
and have the forensic team take it from here.

44
00:04:50,907 --> 00:04:57,981
Ms. Jit, are you absolutely sure
Weechana was home all day yesterday?

45
00:04:59,147 --> 00:05:02,541
You're asking like you don't trust me,
Officer.

46
00:05:04,955 --> 00:05:07,621
We found no trace of Eva.

47
00:05:07,621 --> 00:05:10,301
There's nothing on
the security footage either.

48
00:05:11,211 --> 00:05:13,376
It's okay.

49
00:05:13,376 --> 00:05:15,621
We should have something else
we can work with.

50
00:05:18,968 --> 00:05:20,769
I'll be going now, sir.

51
00:05:40,509 --> 00:05:42,888
You're the reason
the police came searching our house.

52
00:05:42,888 --> 00:05:44,568
Do you even realize that?

53
00:05:44,568 --> 00:05:47,261
You're so obsessed with Eva
you've lost all common sense.

54
00:05:48,739 --> 00:05:50,291
You were going to kill Eva!

55
00:05:50,291 --> 00:05:52,696
If I hadn't shown up,
she'd be dead by now, wouldn't she?

56
00:05:52,696 --> 00:05:57,115
If you hadn't gone there,
this would all be over by now!

57
00:05:57,115 --> 00:05:58,361
Do you have any idea

58
00:05:58,361 --> 00:06:00,187
