I have to pay off because of you?

59
00:06:00,187 --> 00:06:02,541
Where did you take Eva?

60
00:06:05,035 --> 00:06:06,285
I'm not telling you.

61
00:06:06,285 --> 00:06:07,328
Weechana!

62
00:06:07,328 --> 00:06:08,347
I won't tell you!

63
00:06:08,347 --> 00:06:10,608
- Weechana!
- Stop!

64
00:06:10,608 --> 00:06:13,024
Leave me alone! Leave Eva alone!

65
00:06:13,024 --> 00:06:16,001
I'll handle this shit,
so stay the fuck out of it!

66
00:06:19,808 --> 00:06:21,419
Weechana!

67
00:06:21,419 --> 00:06:23,421
Weechana!

68
00:06:27,155 --> 00:06:28,909
Good afternoon, everybody.

69
00:06:28,909 --> 00:06:30,893
Thank you for coming.

70
00:06:30,893 --> 00:06:32,604
I want to make it absolutely clear today

71
00:06:32,604 --> 00:06:36,701
that I had nothing to do with what happened,

72
00:06:37,709 --> 00:06:42,067
especially the abduction of Eva.

73
00:06:42,067 --> 00:06:47,717
As of today,
I ask that everyone give me a fair chance

74
00:06:47,717 --> 00:06:50,099
and wait for the facts to come to light.

75
00:06:50,099 --> 00:06:55,947
This matter is now being handled
through the proper legal process.

76
00:06:55,947 --> 00:06:58,373
There are claims that your family
has powerful people backing you.

77
00:06:58,373 --> 00:07:00,075
Can we really trust that
the investigation will be transparent?

78
00:07:00,075 --> 00:07:02,016
Were you aware of the allegations

79
00:07:02,016 --> 00:07:03,817
that Ms. Chanajit ordered Domino's murder?

80
00:07:05,061 --> 00:07:09,101
I think that's a question for Eva.

81
00:07:09,101 --> 00:07:15,627
I honestly don't know what or who
made her say those things.

82
00:07:15,627 --> 00:07:20,581
But if this was an attempt to discredit me,

83
00:07:21,541 --> 00:07:22,946
I strongly condemn it.

84
00:07:22,946 --> 00:07:27,701
And I will do everything in my power
to defend myself and my party.

85
00:07:27,701 --> 00:07:30,701
But Eva insists she has evidence.

86
00:07:31,602 --> 00:07:33,915
Then let's see the evidence.

87
00:07:33,915 --> 00:07:36,555
I'm a witness,

88
00:07:36,555 --> 00:07:38,941
and my testimony can corroborate
what Eva said.

89
00:07:40,261 --> 00:07:42,062
Pun is here?

90
00:07:44,348 --> 00:07:46,341
I was shot yesterday.

91
00:07:47,176 --> 00:07:50,296
You should know, because you were there.

92
00:07:50,296 --> 00:07:52,221
You were there?

93
00:07:54,253 --> 00:07:56,401
Where is Eva, sir?

94
00:07:57,952 --> 00:07:59,753
I don't know anything about that.

95
00:08:02,059 --> 00:08:05,323
But if you're going to accuse me
in front of the press like this,

96
00:08:06,109 --> 00:08:08,381
you're prepared to face the consequences,
aren't you?

97
00:08:09,107 --> 00:08:10,741
Of course.

98
00:08:10,741 --> 00:08:12,942
Good.

99
00:08:12,942 --> 00:08:16,421
Then I guess we'll settle this
through the legal process.

100
00:08:19,472 --> 00:08:21,613
That'll be all for today.

101
00:08:21,613 --> 00:08:23,541
Thank you all for coming.

102
00:08:25,019 --> 00:08:27,021
Where is Eva?

103
00:08:27,021 --> 00:08:28,888
Weechana, where is Eva?

104
00:08:28,888 --> 00:08:30,488
Where is Eva?

105
00:08:30,488 --> 00:08:32,301
Where is Eva?

106
00:08:35,864 --> 00:08:37,665
Where is Eva?

107
00:08:40,722 --> 00:08:42,523
Where is Eva?

108
00:09:05,267 --> 00:09:07,221
You fucking idiots!
I can't trust you to do one damn thing right!

109
00:09:07,221 --> 00:09:10,387
Who the fuck let Pun in there like that?

110
00:09:10,387 --> 00:09:13,341
Were you not fucking watching the place?

111
00:09:13,341 --> 00:09:15,342
I swear I'm gonna fire every last one of you!

112
00:09:16,120 --> 00:09:18,213
- Calm down.
- Don't tell me to calm down.

113
00:09:18,213 --> 00:09:20,201
You need to get yourself together.

114
00:09:21,829 --> 00:09:26,245
Pun will be a dead man by tomorrow.

115
00:09:26,245 --> 00:09:28,136
Hey, calm down.

116
00:09:28,136 --> 00:09:30,221
We need to find a way to turn this around.

117
00:09:30,221 --> 00:09:33,981
The election's tomorrow.
You can't lose your shit now!

118
00:09:36,355 --> 00:09:38,504
You go check on Eva.

119
00:09:38,504 --> 00:09:40,821
I'll handle this.

120
00:09:43,923 --> 00:09:49,301
Get 50 million ready
and send our people out to every district.

121
00:09:49,301 --> 00:09:51,801
We can't afford to lose votes now.

122
00:09:56,213 --> 00:09:58,840
What the fuck are you standing around for?

123
00:09:58,840 --> 00:10:00,619
Go!

124
00:10:00,619 --> 00:10:02,821
What the hell is wrong with you people?

125
00:10:05,550 --> 00:10:07,723
Fucking idiots!

126
00:11:14,733 --> 00:11:16,061
Yes?

127
00:11:16,061 --> 00:11:18,643
<i>My men said Weechai's here.</i>

128
00:11:18,643 --> 00:11:22,621
<i>From what they've told me,
Eva's doing okay. Don't worry.</i>

129
00:11:22,621 --> 00:11:24,421
Okay.

130
00:11:24,421 --> 00:11:26,840
