131
00:11:26,840 --> 00:11:28,451
<i>Hey.</i>

132
00:11:28,451 --> 00:11:31,731
<i>You shouldn't be there.
You'll mess everything up.</i>

133
00:11:31,731 --> 00:11:33,357
<i>Just hold on a little longer.</i>

134
00:11:33,357 --> 00:11:35,848
<i>It'll all be over tomorrow.</i>

135
00:11:35,848 --> 00:11:37,715
Okay.

136
00:11:37,715 --> 00:11:39,801
