for the official vote count</i>

150
00:12:54,894 --> 00:12:57,293
<i>from the Election Commission,</i>

151
00:12:57,293 --> 00:13:01,301
<i>with a clearer picture
expected to emerge later this evening.</i>

152
00:13:01,301 --> 00:13:03,560
- Please look this way.
- Please look at this camera.

153
00:13:03,560 --> 00:13:06,493
- Please look this way.
- Please look over here.

154
00:13:09,251 --> 00:13:12,845
Be sure to tune in to our live stream,

155
00:13:12,845 --> 00:13:14,558
and let's follow the results together.

156
00:13:14,558 --> 00:13:17,341
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

157
00:13:17,341 --> 00:13:19,581
