to deal with your problems.

169
00:14:28,821 --> 00:14:30,622
I know.

170
00:14:31,981 --> 00:14:33,484
Thanks, man.

171
00:14:34,320 --> 00:14:36,724
- Please look over here.
- Let's go.

172
00:14:55,629 --> 00:14:57,341
Good evening, everyone.

173
00:14:57,341 --> 00:14:59,923
Tonight, we're here to follow
the vote count together.

174
00:14:59,923 --> 00:15:03,037
And based on the unofficial results so far,

175
00:15:03,037 --> 00:15:06,341
our Ruam Thai Chana Party
is still very much in the running.

176
00:15:14,035 --> 00:15:15,496
And next,

177
00:15:15,496 --> 00:15:18,429
I'd like to invite Mr. Weechana
to say a few words.

178
00:15:18,429 --> 00:15:19,480
Please give him a round of applause.

179
00:15:19,480 --> 00:15:21,581
<i>Wait for more people.</i>

180
00:15:25,780 --> 00:15:27,581
Thank you so much.

181
00:15:28,531 --> 00:15:33,933
My family and I are deeply grateful
for every single vote you've given us.

182
00:15:33,933 --> 00:15:36,203
Thank you for believing in us,

183
00:15:36,203 --> 00:15:40,221
and thank you for continuing
to trust us to serve you.

184
00:15:57,739 --> 00:15:59,901
We're closed.

185
00:16:01,941 --> 00:16:03,861
I'm coming for you.

186
00:16:03,861 --> 00:16:05,203
You think this is funny?

187
00:16:05,203 --> 00:16:07,032
You want a piece of me?

188
00:16:07,032 --> 00:16:08,221
This is not funny.

189
00:16:08,221 --> 00:16:09,923
Let me go!

190
00:16:09,923 --> 00:16:12,301
- Let me go!
- Hey, calm down.

191
00:16:13,128 --> 00:16:15,461
Who are you? It's none of your business.

192
00:16:15,461 --> 00:16:16,499
Please calm down.

193
00:16:16,499 --> 00:16:17,877
You!

