202
00:16:51,589 --> 00:16:54,416
Please come up and say a few words.

203
00:16:54,416 --> 00:16:56,056
<i>It's time.</i>

204
00:16:56,056 --> 00:17:00,181
Please welcome Chaichana, my father.

205
00:17:07,941 --> 00:17:09,742
Hello.

206
00:17:21,485 --> 00:17:23,133
Is that Ginny?

207
00:17:23,133 --> 00:17:24,234
What is going on?

208
00:17:24,234 --> 00:17:26,941
Ginny's dead. How is she here?

209
00:17:27,701 --> 00:17:29,405
How is Ginny here?

210
00:17:29,405 --> 00:17:31,528
Isn't she dead?

211
00:17:31,528 --> 00:17:33,533
Someone's going to cut the stream
for five seconds.

212
00:17:33,533 --> 00:17:36,581
I have the passwords
to all the party's accounts.

213
00:17:36,581 --> 00:17:38,461
Can you hijack the stream in time?

214
00:17:39,222 --> 00:17:40,789
Yeah.

215
00:17:44,733 --> 00:17:46,669
<i>Hi, this is Ginny.</i>

216
00:17:46,669 --> 00:17:51,717
<i>Today, I have a little story
I'd like to share with everyone.</i>

217
00:17:51,717 --> 00:17:58,061
<i>A few months ago,
I asked to speak with Ms. Chanajit</i>

218
00:17:58,896 --> 00:18:03,931
<i>about my relationship with Weechana.</i>

219
00:18:03,931 --> 00:18:06,187
<i>But not long after that,</i>

220
00:18:06,187 --> 00:18:09,541
<i>I had a severe allergic reaction
to something I ate and started bleeding.</i>

221
00:18:10,589 --> 00:18:12,701
What a coincidence, right?

222
00:18:13,331 --> 00:18:15,747
But guess what?

223
00:18:15,747 --> 00:18:18,520
<i>I'm still alive.</i>

224
00:18:18,520 --> 00:18:21,093
No... no...

225
00:18:21,093 --> 00:18:22,963
That's not true!

226
00:18:22,963 --> 00:18:24,139
- Not true.
- Weechai!

227
00:18:24,139 --> 00:18:26,701
Weechai, shut it down.

228
00:18:30,609 --> 00:18:33,369
<i>Unfortunately,</i>

229
00:18:33,369 --> 00:18:36,341
<i>my friend wasn't as lucky as you were.</i>

230
00:18:38,635 --> 00:18:40,941
<i>Domino didn't make it, everyone,</i>

231
00:18:41,723 --> 00:18:43,981
<i>because of that heartless old bitch.</i>

232
00:18:45,627 --> 00:18:48,416
<i>Let's listen to the recording.</i>

233
00:18:48,416 --> 00:18:50,592
<i>Grandma Jit told you
